excitement. But there's a difference between a good bingo game and a great one. Here's how to make yours unforgettable."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before the Party: Setup"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Choose Your Bingo Style"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"There are two main approaches to party bingo:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Caller Bingo"}]," — Someone reads items aloud, guests mark matches. Fast-paced and exciting, best for dedicated game time."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Event Bingo"}]," — Squares describe things that might happen at the party. Guests mark squares throughout the event as moments happen organically. Low-maintenance and runs in the background."]}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Create Your Cards"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Use ",["$","$L9",null,{"href":"/create","children":"MyBingoCard's free generator"}]," to create custom cards. A few key tips:"]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Use 30-40 unique items even though only 24 fit per card — this ensures variety"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Mix easy and hard items for balanced gameplay"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Include inside jokes that your specific group will appreciate"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Print 20% more cards than your guest count"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Prepare Prizes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Prizes are what separate \"meh\" bingo from \"legendary\" bingo. You don't need expensive prizes — creativity wins:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Gift cards"}]," — Even $5-10 creates real competition"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Candy/treats"}]," — A bag of good chocolate never disappoints"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fun trophies"}]," — Dollar store crowns, silly hats, or toy medals"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Privileges"}]," — First pick of dessert, DJ song request, exempt from cleanup"]}],"$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}],"$L2c"]}]}]}]
